     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ValueSet BRPapelProblemaDiagnostico</b></p><a name=\"BRPapelProblemaDiagnostico\"> </a><a name=\"hcBRPapelProblemaDiagnostico\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Última atualização: 2020-03-11 19:14:51+0000; Língua: en</p></div><p>Este conjunto de valores inclui códigos baseados nas seguintes regras:</p><ul><li>Incluir todos os códigos definidos em <a href=\"CodeSystem-BRPapelProblemaDiagnostico.html\"><code>http://www.saude.gov.br/fhir/r4/CodeSystem/BRPapelProblemaDiagnostico</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> versão ?1.0.0-release</span></li><li>Incluir estes códigos, tal como definidos em <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/diagnosis-role</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 1.1.1, the version found through the package references\"> versão ?1.1.1</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td><td><b>Definição</b></td><td><b>Portuguese (Brazil) (pt)</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-AD\">AD</a></td><td>Admission diagnosis</td><td>The diagnoses documented for administrative purposes as the basis for a hospital or other institutional admission</td><td>Diagnóstico presente na admissão</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-DD\">DD</a></td><td>Discharge diagnosis</td><td>The diagnoses documented for administrative purposes at the time of hospital or other institutional discharge</td><td>Diagnóstico de alta</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-CC\">CC</a></td><td>Chief complaint</td><td/><td>Queixa principal.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-CM\">CM</a></td><td>Comorbidity diagnosis</td><td/><td>Diagnóstico de comorbidade</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-pre-op\">pre-op</a></td><td>pre-op diagnosis</td><td/><td>Diagnóstico pré-operatório</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-post-op\">post-op</a></td><td>post-op diagnosis</td><td/><td>Diagnóstico pós-operatório</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-diagnosis-role.html#diagnosis-role-billing\">billing</a></td><td>Billing</td><td>The diagnosis documented for billing purposes</td><td>Faturamento</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
